            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">After that, the credit disappears for good.<br>
            Don&rsquo;t let your money go to waste &mdash; spend it at <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color: #1990C6;">LABalloons.com</a> today!</p>

