                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Can&rsquo;t find your credit code?<br>
            Just reply to this email and we&rsquo;ll send it again!</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">We appreciate your business, and thank you for trusting us with your balloon and party supply needs!</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Your support means the world to our team.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">- LA Balloons</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5;"><strong>** Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong><br>
            This voucher is distributed entirely for free as part of a temporary marketing promotion; no monetary value or thing of value was paid in exchange for it. No cash value &amp; non-transferable. Valid only for merchandise online at <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color: #1990C6;">www.laballoons.com</a>. This code cannot be redeemed for cash, and is explicitly exempt from California&rsquo;s mandatory gift certificate cash-out regulations. Lost, deleted, or stolen promotional codes will not be replaced. Expires on 10/19/2026.</p>
          </td>
        </tr>

